{"id":"923be44c9742df37","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-quadfunc.md","title":"Quadratic Boolean function and quadratic DNF","display":"df-quadfunc — Quadratic Boolean function and quadratic DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-quadfunc","aliases":["27-df-quadfunc"],"display":"df-quadfunc — Quadratic Boolean function and quadratic DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.1","source_statement":"Definitions 5.1–5.2","source_printed_pages":"203","source_pdf_pages":"227","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-quadfunc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-quadfunc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quadfunc — Quadratic Boolean function and quadratic DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definitions 5.1–5.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"203"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"227"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\leq2)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\leq2)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definitions 5.1–5.2。二次约束作用于所存在的 DNF 项长度，允许常数、一次项，不要求给定的任意 DNF 都是二次。它与实多线性次数≤2的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a> 不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-dnf]]），$\\mathrm{Lits}$（see [[27-df-litset]]），$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-boolfunc]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-dnf]]），$\\mathrm{Lits}$（see [[27-df-litset]]），$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-boolfunc]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-dnf]]），$\\mathrm{Lits}$（see [[27-df-litset]]），$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-boolfunc]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definitions 5.1–5.2。二次约束作用于所存在的 DNF 项长度，允许常数、一次项，不要求给定的任意 DNF 都是二次。它与实多线性次数≤2的 [[27-df-quadpb]] 不同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\leq2)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1484,"backlinks":[{"id":"198879e40a0ec5d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$ 且 $T_\\varnothing\\notin D$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},x_i,\\bar x_i$ 取该 DNF 接口含义。"},{"id":"07dcb8bee101c949","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-quadfunc]]；$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。"},{"id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},T_L$ 取该 DNF 接口的含义。"},{"id":"1783030450408811","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\